WEBVTT

00:04.460 --> 00:07.830
<b>EXCALIBUR ACADEMY - 2 YEARS AGO</b>

00:28.500 --> 00:32.790
The technique my sisters taught me
is burned into my memory...

00:33.040 --> 00:37.500
If Holy Swords are a manifestation of the soul,
then mine ought to take the shape of a sword...

00:43.790 --> 00:45.830
Enough of this pointless nonsense.

00:46.210 --> 00:47.380
Musel Rhodes...

00:48.080 --> 00:51.000
There's no need for you to train like this.

00:51.210 --> 00:53.920
Didn't I already tell you I'd let you join my platoon?

00:54.130 --> 00:55.040
No thanks.

00:55.830 --> 01:00.210
I wonder how long you can afford to be stubborn,
seeing as you don't have a Holy Sword...

01:01.130 --> 01:03.290
Please don't touch Lady Riselia!

01:03.290 --> 01:05.130
Holy Sword, activate!

01:08.540 --> 01:11.420
The use of Holy Swords
in private disputes is prohibited...

01:11.630 --> 01:14.040
Whatever. I'd suggest you simmer down.

01:16.040 --> 01:16.710
Hmph.

01:16.710 --> 01:21.210
You'll make quick work of guys like him
once you awaken your Holy Sword, milady!

01:21.420 --> 01:24.080
That's NOT the reason I want a Holy Sword of my own!

01:27.500 --> 01:30.380
Will I ever get one...?

01:31.130 --> 01:33.080
Of course you will. I KNOW it!

03:18.290 --> 03:20.380
<b>AN AWAKENING SOUL</b>

03:24.460 --> 03:26.170
Good morning.

03:28.880 --> 03:30.710
Wasn't I in the bathroom...?

03:31.290 --> 03:37.420
I carried you to bed. Er... I used sorcery
so I wouldn't have to touch you. I didn't peep either.

03:39.540 --> 03:41.580
Who are you, Leo?

03:43.210 --> 03:46.040
I'm the reincarnation of an ancient sorcerer.

03:46.540 --> 03:50.630
Back in my day, magic was a skill
that people themselves harnessed.

03:50.630 --> 03:56.210
That same sorcery is how
I resurrected you as one of my minions.

03:56.630 --> 03:58.790
Not with a Holy Sword...?

03:58.920 --> 04:02.170
It's a Level 10 spell, Create Elder Undead.

04:02.170 --> 04:05.750
To be honest, it was a gamble,
but the results were better than anticipated.

04:06.170 --> 04:10.380
You're now the most prestigious
type of undead there is: a Vampire Queen.

04:10.830 --> 04:13.170
A vampire? Me...?

04:13.420 --> 04:20.170
Your weakened state yesterday was due to insufficient
mana. That's why you sought out my blood, Miss Selia.

04:20.830 --> 04:24.880
A natural response, given that it's necessary
to replenish your mana supply.

04:26.790 --> 04:29.210
So you weren't kidding when you said I died.

04:29.630 --> 04:30.630
I'm sorry.

04:32.130 --> 04:35.460
It was the only means available in order to save you.

04:37.330 --> 04:39.830
Is it alright if I tell you a bit about myself?

04:40.380 --> 04:41.040
Sure.

04:41.670 --> 04:45.380
When I was nine years old,
my hometown was attacked by Voids.

04:45.790 --> 04:49.130
It was a large-scale outbreak,
what we refer to as a "Stampede."

04:50.170 --> 04:52.420
Everyone in my family was a Holy Swordsman.

04:52.420 --> 04:55.830
They fought to protect
the city's inhabitants... and they died.

04:56.290 --> 05:00.540
Regina and I survived in the shelter,
and Excalibur Academy took custody of us.

05:00.830 --> 05:03.790
Being a Holy Swordsman runs in my blood,
so it made sense.

05:04.210 --> 05:06.920
Fighting Voids might speed up the awakening process.

05:07.420 --> 05:09.830
That was my rationale
for participating in dangerous missions.

05:10.710 --> 05:11.790
But...

05:12.170 --> 05:15.540
...she's been unable to live up to their expectations.

05:16.000 --> 05:20.130
Leo... if I'm not alive,
can I still be blessed with a Holy Sword?

05:20.250 --> 05:24.710
I don't know. But you're going to be
vastly stronger than before.

05:27.960 --> 05:29.790
I hope you're right...

05:37.040 --> 05:41.580
You haven't had anything to eat since last night,
have you? That's no good for a growing boy.

05:41.580 --> 05:43.290
I'm perfectly fine!

05:43.630 --> 05:46.920
Damn this absurd human body of mine...!

05:54.580 --> 05:58.670
I don't have much of an appetite... Can I still eat food?

05:58.960 --> 06:01.920
You're the most elite species of vampire,
so you certainly can.

06:02.130 --> 06:06.290
However, your digestive system
isn't very efficient at converting food into mana.

06:06.540 --> 06:07.460
Ah...

06:07.710 --> 06:09.330
What are you going to have, Leo?

06:10.170 --> 06:11.380
I'll settle for a pastry.

06:11.380 --> 06:14.130
I'm a little lost since I don't recognize
anything on this menu...

06:14.130 --> 06:17.080
A pastry isn't enough. Nutrition is important, y'know!

06:17.210 --> 06:21.000
Nutrition...? That's rich, coming from an undead.

06:22.630 --> 06:25.000
I-I shouldn't have said that...

06:25.130 --> 06:26.330
Meanie...

06:26.670 --> 06:31.130
I became an undead voluntarily
and had Roselia to guide me. This poor girl didn't...

06:31.580 --> 06:33.710
How about I pick something out for you?

06:33.830 --> 06:36.330
Yes, please. I'll pay for it, though.

06:36.330 --> 06:36.830
Huh?

06:43.750 --> 06:46.130
Stunned into silence, eh?

06:46.750 --> 06:47.670
What's that?

06:48.130 --> 06:52.500
A gold Raydor coin. A single one of these
could buy everything in this whole restaurant.

06:53.250 --> 06:55.960
Um... you can't use that.

06:55.960 --> 06:58.170
The Assault Gardens only accept credit as payment.

06:58.170 --> 06:58.710
Wha-?!

06:58.880 --> 07:02.710
B-but even if it can't be used as currency,
gold must be considered precious...

07:02.710 --> 07:06.630
No, not really. Alchemically forged silver
is far more valuable.

07:06.750 --> 07:09.380
So the two thousand gold coins in funds I set aside

07:09.380 --> 07:12.290
to rebuild my Demon Lord Army
are essentially worthless...?!

07:12.420 --> 07:14.170
I already paid you what I owed.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.920
And you're accruing interest as we speak.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.580
I don't have any cash on me.

07:18.710 --> 07:21.380
Can you wait until I get my paycheck next week?

07:21.380 --> 07:23.380
Not without some sort of collateral.

07:23.790 --> 07:25.630
Mighty fine clothes ya got there.

07:25.920 --> 07:28.420
We'd be willin' to wait if ya let us hang onto 'em.

07:29.290 --> 07:30.210
Hands off.

07:30.290 --> 07:31.250
Excuse me?!

07:31.250 --> 07:32.540
C'mon, hurry up and strip-

07:38.710 --> 07:40.880
I'm a student at this school.

07:42.330 --> 07:45.540
I won't run or hide. Come back for the money next week.

07:46.330 --> 07:48.630
She's well-versed with a sword...

07:48.960 --> 07:50.920
Sakuya, who were those men?

07:50.920 --> 07:56.460
Bouncers from the casino I went to yesterday.
They came to collect, so I asked them to leave.

07:56.460 --> 07:59.420
Didn't you have make-up lessons
for the exam you failed?

07:59.670 --> 08:02.790
Indeed. Sorry I couldn't accompany you on the mission.

08:03.330 --> 08:07.040
After my lessons, I went out
for a night on the town to try and strike it rich!

08:07.710 --> 08:09.880
And as a result, I'm flat broke.

08:12.080 --> 08:15.210
Wow, an antique coin. What a neat little trinket.

08:15.830 --> 08:19.000
Are you the kid with his own Holy Sword?

08:19.420 --> 08:21.460
Sounds like you talked to Finé.

08:21.460 --> 08:24.250
Sakuya is our platoon's vanguard attacker.

08:24.500 --> 08:28.710
Even as a newcomer, she's slain several Voids
on her own. Few students can say that.

08:28.710 --> 08:31.330
Sakuya Sieglinde. Nice to meet you.

08:31.580 --> 08:33.130
I'm Leonis Magnus.

08:33.790 --> 08:37.210
I knew it. The hand of someone who lives by the blade...

08:38.960 --> 08:41.790
Alright, you two. Lunch is on Big Sis today!

08:41.790 --> 08:42.960
Thank you.

08:44.630 --> 08:45.710
Much appreciated.

08:52.670 --> 08:56.210
Your clothes are different
from the standard uniform, Miss Sakuya...

08:57.130 --> 09:00.080
It's the traditional attire of Ouran, my homeland.

09:00.460 --> 09:01.920
A memento of my older sister.

09:02.330 --> 09:04.790
My village's clan was wiped out by Voids...

09:05.040 --> 09:07.960
I've dedicated myself to killing those creatures...

09:08.710 --> 09:10.500
She seeks vengeance...

09:10.960 --> 09:14.080
Sakuya, you still owe me from two days ago!

09:14.080 --> 09:16.170
Can I pay you back next week?

09:16.380 --> 09:20.040
Jeez... All you do is gamble.
No wonder you fail your exams!

09:24.540 --> 09:27.500
I'm Diglassê Alto. I'll be conducting your inquiry.

09:28.250 --> 09:29.580
It's a pleasure, ma'am!

09:29.830 --> 09:31.290
No need to be nervous.

09:31.710 --> 09:34.540
I'm just here to determine the type
of Holy Sword you possess.

09:34.540 --> 09:37.330
Let's get started.
Go ahead and show me your Holy Sword.

09:37.330 --> 09:38.290
Of course.

09:38.540 --> 09:40.960
Come forth, Wicked Staff of Sins!

09:41.540 --> 09:43.540
A staff... And its ability type?

09:43.960 --> 09:46.710
Um... support type, I guess.

09:46.880 --> 09:48.830
It kinda depends on the situation.

09:48.830 --> 09:50.630
I see, an all-purpose type...

09:51.040 --> 09:51.960
What are those?

09:51.960 --> 09:55.130
Void Simulators. You're going to fight them.

09:56.250 --> 10:00.000
Assuming it's a support type,
we'll need a vanguard to observe its capacity for-

10:04.080 --> 10:07.330
He flattened a whole row
of Metachalcum Void Simulators?!

10:07.920 --> 10:10.880
Oh crap! I meant to tone it down a little...

10:11.040 --> 10:15.000
I-I thought you said it was a support type!
What on Earth was that?!

10:15.250 --> 10:17.960
An extremely lucky shot, maybe?

10:18.130 --> 10:19.380
I find that hard to believe!

10:19.380 --> 10:21.420
She's starting to get suspicious...

10:22.250 --> 10:23.290
What just happened?

10:23.290 --> 10:24.380
What's going on?

10:24.830 --> 10:26.750
This requires a thorough investigation...

10:26.880 --> 10:29.080
I'll need to prepare an alternative simulator...

10:29.290 --> 10:31.670
You could have him fight me instead.

10:31.790 --> 10:32.380
Hmm?

10:32.540 --> 10:33.290
Huh?

10:39.130 --> 10:41.250
Musel Rhodes...

10:42.540 --> 10:49.040
I'll handle the kid's inquiry from here. As a top-notch
Holy Swordsman, I have the necessary qualifications.

10:49.290 --> 10:54.380
Fine by me. You're going to be the stand-in
for that pile of useless garbage, right?

10:54.380 --> 10:55.630
Stupid brat...

10:55.880 --> 10:57.500
Holy Sword, activate!

10:59.790 --> 11:02.210
Four against one?! That's totally unfair!

11:02.630 --> 11:07.460
It's the ability of my Holy Sword, Dominion: "Iron Fist."

11:07.670 --> 11:10.750
These lovely ladies are a part of my weapon.

11:11.630 --> 11:13.500
I suppose that makes sense.

11:13.500 --> 11:16.630
So I'd have to defeat those four along
with Mr. Musel, correct?

11:16.630 --> 11:19.460
If you allow him to conduct your inquiry, yes.

11:19.790 --> 11:21.920
Then I get to fight with Leo!

11:22.210 --> 11:22.790
Huh?

11:22.960 --> 11:25.330
I'm his guardian, so it's only fair!

11:26.380 --> 11:28.380
She makes a good point...

11:30.330 --> 11:33.630
Why not? But on one condition...

11:33.630 --> 11:34.290
What?

11:34.420 --> 11:37.040
If you lose, you have to join my platoon.

11:37.580 --> 11:38.750
Are you serious?!

11:38.920 --> 11:40.130
I accept.

11:40.130 --> 11:40.960
What?!

11:41.170 --> 11:47.380
But if YOU lose, Mr. Musel... you have to swear
never to mess with Miss Selia again.

11:47.670 --> 11:48.790
Alright, fine.

11:48.790 --> 11:49.830
Leo...

11:50.250 --> 11:54.420
I have absolutely no intention of handing
one of my minions over to a bastard like him.

11:55.630 --> 11:56.290
Right!

11:56.580 --> 11:59.380
Ma'am? May I borrow a training sword?

12:00.790 --> 12:02.330
Choose whichever one you like.

12:03.750 --> 12:06.920
Whoever loses consciousness
or surrenders first, is the loser.

12:08.330 --> 12:11.460
I reserve the power to stop the fight
if things get too dangerous.

12:12.790 --> 12:15.170
Now then, let the Holy Sword battle begin!

12:18.380 --> 12:19.330
What the hell...?

12:23.000 --> 12:23.960
Stay out of my way!

12:26.250 --> 12:29.830
Huh... That level of skill
isn't from her vampire transformation alone.

12:29.830 --> 12:32.420
She's put a great deal of effort into her swordsmanship.

12:36.290 --> 12:38.080
Hey, go kick the brat's ass!

12:38.580 --> 12:39.460
Leo!

12:39.830 --> 12:40.750
Don't worry!

12:41.080 --> 12:43.580
I have to make sure
I don't go overboard with it this time...

12:45.130 --> 12:48.630
Come forth, spirits of the Shadow Kingdom. Mesta Mord!

12:57.880 --> 13:01.540
Are you just going to use these girls as shields
or what, Musel Rhodes?!

13:02.460 --> 13:03.420
Yeah, she's right!

13:03.420 --> 13:04.750
Don't be a coward!

13:07.420 --> 13:11.330
I totally overslept and missed the kid's
Holy Sword inquiry!

13:13.540 --> 13:14.790
Lady Selia...?!

13:14.960 --> 13:16.380
Wait, what's going on?!

13:16.500 --> 13:17.040
Take that!

13:23.960 --> 13:27.000
Now there's no one left to hide behind!

13:32.920 --> 13:34.830
But how...?!

13:34.920 --> 13:38.250
It's an effect of Iron Fist called "Force."

13:41.540 --> 13:44.000
Got your hopes up for a second, eh?

13:44.830 --> 13:48.670
What a shame you'll never be able to beat me...

13:51.130 --> 13:55.630
Well then... I guess I ought to dispose
of the annoying brat first.

13:58.880 --> 14:00.540
So the rest is up to me...

14:00.960 --> 14:03.460
She lacks experience, but she has potential.

14:03.670 --> 14:05.500
I have to protect Leo...

14:05.790 --> 14:09.750
I have to protect Leo... I have to protect Leo...

14:09.750 --> 14:11.960
I have to protect Leo...

14:12.210 --> 14:14.670
Even without a Holy Sword...

14:19.210 --> 14:21.960
I WILL protect Leo!

14:29.130 --> 14:31.290
Is that a Holy Sword...?

14:31.580 --> 14:34.460
The last remaining vestige of the Crystalia family...

14:44.380 --> 14:47.040
You managed to escape my control...?!

14:55.170 --> 14:56.420
Not my Holy Sword...!

14:57.420 --> 14:57.830
Huh?

15:03.330 --> 15:04.580
Well, Musel?

15:04.960 --> 15:08.380
S-surrender... I surrender!

15:09.420 --> 15:11.880
Lady Selia!

15:12.330 --> 15:16.420
I knew you could do it!
I KNEW you'd awaken it eventually!

15:16.500 --> 15:18.250
Thanks, Regina!

15:21.130 --> 15:23.750
I've got my very own Holy Sword!

15:27.750 --> 15:29.630
Thanks, Leo.

15:29.630 --> 15:32.130
Oh, there's no need to thank me.

15:32.130 --> 15:34.710
You're one of my minions, Miss Selia.

15:34.710 --> 15:37.210
I meant to ask... what exactly is a "minion"?

15:37.210 --> 15:40.250
Minions exist to protect their master.

15:43.420 --> 15:47.040
I get it. Big Sis promises to protect you from here on out!

15:48.170 --> 15:49.830
But I have a favor to ask...

15:50.210 --> 15:51.250
What is it?

15:52.210 --> 15:54.420
I want you to make me even stronger.

15:54.920 --> 15:57.460
Sure. I'd like that, too.

15:59.380 --> 16:05.250
In honor of Lady Selia's Holy Sword awakening
and Leo's induction into the 18th Platoon!

16:07.250 --> 16:08.380
Wow...

16:08.380 --> 16:10.500
Regina was the one who prepared all this.

16:10.750 --> 16:14.000
Congrats, Selia. I'm so happy for you!

16:14.000 --> 16:18.500
I couldn't wait to see you be rewarded for your tireless
dedication to your training.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.380
What kind of Holy Sword is it?

16:20.670 --> 16:22.710
A lightweight sword with a sharp blade.

16:22.710 --> 16:26.580
Then what do you think about
"Swishing Slasher" as its official name?

16:26.580 --> 16:29.830
No way! "Shining Saint Sword" would be way cooler!

16:31.290 --> 16:34.920
But something tells me
I haven't even seen its true potential yet.

16:35.330 --> 16:38.670
I'll give it a name after I've gotten a feel for wielding it.

16:39.130 --> 16:42.330
And starting today, the kid is officially one of us!

16:42.710 --> 16:44.290
Oh, that reminds me, Leo...

16:44.500 --> 16:49.500
I need to upload your biodata to the academy's network,
so drop by my room later, okay?

16:49.500 --> 16:50.710
Sure thing.

16:50.880 --> 16:53.710
Speaking of rooms, where are you staying?

16:53.710 --> 16:57.710
All our extra rooms are being used for storage.
There's nowhere for you to sleep.

16:57.880 --> 16:59.580
Wanna stay in my room?

16:59.710 --> 17:02.330
You'll get boatloads of homemade sweets every day!

17:02.460 --> 17:04.000
You're welcome in my room, too.

17:04.380 --> 17:06.790
I'm usually not at home, so you'll have free rein.

17:06.920 --> 17:10.210
You can stay in my room. I'll even help you study.

17:10.920 --> 17:13.080
Q-quit that!

17:13.420 --> 17:14.540
Milady...?

17:14.540 --> 17:17.040
I think Leo should stay in my room!

17:17.170 --> 17:18.170
How come?

17:18.170 --> 17:20.000
W-well, um...

17:20.000 --> 17:23.080
Miss Selia was the one who found me in those ruins...

17:23.080 --> 17:26.750
Exactly! At the end of the day, I'm Leo's guardian!

17:26.920 --> 17:30.420
And for some reason,
I feel very at ease in Miss Selia's room...

17:30.750 --> 17:32.710
Well, if the kid says so...

17:32.710 --> 17:34.080
Then that settles it.

17:34.080 --> 17:35.540
I have no objections.

17:36.210 --> 17:40.420
Sharing a room will make it much easier for us
to keep each other's secret...

17:42.210 --> 17:46.500
These orbs are your Holy Sword... right, Miss Elfiné?

17:46.750 --> 17:51.920
Eye of the Witch. Its main abilities include
the collection, analysis, and transmission of data...

17:52.210 --> 17:53.330
...now, anyway.

17:53.330 --> 17:54.330
What do you mean?

17:54.420 --> 17:58.380
In my previous platoon, I was an attacker
in charge of supplying the firepower.

17:58.380 --> 18:03.540
But during one of our missions,
I watched two of my friends die, killed by Voids...

18:04.130 --> 18:08.420
When that happened,
my Holy Sword lost its original abilities.

18:08.670 --> 18:13.040
I couldn't fight anymore,
but Selia invited me to join her platoon.

18:14.460 --> 18:16.710
Alright, your registration is complete.

18:17.460 --> 18:21.210
"Cute face... Often found ogling breasts..."

18:21.210 --> 18:23.250
What kind of data are you collecting?!

18:23.250 --> 18:24.330
Just kidding!

18:26.630 --> 18:28.500
Is that a map?

18:28.500 --> 18:29.130
Yes.

18:29.130 --> 18:30.710
Do you mind if I have a look at it?

18:30.710 --> 18:33.130
In that case, I'll lend you my spare tablet.

18:38.460 --> 18:40.290
I don't understand how it works...

18:40.290 --> 18:43.380
But it's pretty easy to use, just like she said it'd be.

18:44.000 --> 18:45.830
Death Hold was here.

18:45.830 --> 18:47.830
We're currently in the Sidon Wastelands...

18:48.080 --> 18:50.290
I think there was land here a millennium ago.

18:50.540 --> 18:54.750
This is where my army fought tooth and nail
against the Great Sage Arkael.

18:55.040 --> 18:59.580
There's a correlation between outbreaks of these
"Void" creatures and the locations of ancient battles...

19:00.500 --> 19:01.290
Blackus.

19:06.040 --> 19:07.960
You called, my friend?

19:08.250 --> 19:11.630
Tell me everything you've learned
from your investigation thus far.

19:11.920 --> 19:15.210
Of course. I caught wind of some intriguing information...

19:15.460 --> 19:16.420
Oh?

19:16.420 --> 19:20.290
This floating island has a subterranean core
equipped with an enormous mana crystal.

19:20.790 --> 19:23.380
The humans were calling it a "power plant."

19:23.710 --> 19:30.500
Hm... Goblin Lord Dizolf made use of mana crystals
to power his castle... Perhaps it's the same thing.

19:30.630 --> 19:34.250
This one is massive in size. What's more,
it's outfitted with intricate electrical circuits.

19:34.250 --> 19:36.710
It seems to be distributing mana to the entire city.

19:37.210 --> 19:42.290
Their technology is remarkable... But it would be
a valuable asset if I could get my hands on it.

19:42.630 --> 19:46.500
A brilliant idea as always, Lord Magnus.
Then I shall continue my investigation.

19:46.500 --> 19:47.330
Please do.

19:50.540 --> 19:52.330
I have returned from my mission.

19:52.630 --> 19:53.750
Perfect timing!

19:53.880 --> 19:55.460
Shary, go ahead with your report.

19:56.040 --> 19:57.580
For you, milord.

19:58.000 --> 19:59.000
What is it?

19:59.080 --> 20:01.170
A baked good called a "donut," milord.

20:01.580 --> 20:03.250
Why is there a hole in it?

20:03.330 --> 20:05.630
To ensure an even cooking of the dough.

20:08.380 --> 20:09.580
How is it?

20:09.580 --> 20:10.460
Tasty.

20:10.710 --> 20:12.920
That's not all. I bought several other items, too.

20:12.920 --> 20:15.460
Like this cream puff, and some stretchy ice cream, and-

20:15.460 --> 20:16.500
Wait, slow down!

20:16.500 --> 20:20.750
That's enough about food.
You didn't spend this whole time goofing off, did you?

20:21.210 --> 20:23.790
I also happened to gather some intel.

20:25.040 --> 20:30.000
No one in this city knows anything about you,
nor about the war that took place a thousand years ago.

20:30.500 --> 20:31.960
My suspicions were correct...

20:33.080 --> 20:37.250
But I find it strange that the world
somehow forgot a major war...

20:37.250 --> 20:40.710
Milord, you turned that girl into your minion, didn't you?

20:41.080 --> 20:42.420
Is there a problem?

20:42.710 --> 20:45.330
As if I care... you dumb Demon Lord...

20:45.500 --> 20:49.460
Hey, I heard that! You dare call your master "dumb"?!

20:49.460 --> 20:53.290
She's a Vampire Queen, the mightiest class of undead!

20:53.290 --> 20:57.040
With some training, she could be
my right-hand man and my most valuable asset!

20:57.250 --> 20:59.130
Right-hand man...?

20:59.500 --> 21:01.250
What are you so angry for?

21:01.460 --> 21:03.830
No reason. I hate you, milord.

21:04.080 --> 21:07.670
I don't get you, Shary.
You've always been a mystery to me...

21:07.670 --> 21:08.830
Leo?

21:08.830 --> 21:09.500
Yes?!

21:13.170 --> 21:15.380
The bath is all yours now.

21:15.380 --> 21:16.710
O-okay!

21:17.790 --> 21:19.880
Shouldn't you put some clothes on?!

21:25.880 --> 21:27.920
Number 03, checking in.

21:28.210 --> 21:30.710
As of right now, we're seeing no signs of a Void outbreak

21:31.880 --> 21:32.790
Roger.

21:33.210 --> 21:35.880
Expand the target area
and proceed with the investigation.

21:36.330 --> 21:38.460
Hold on... What's that?

21:49.290 --> 21:52.960
Le... o... nis...

23:27.040 --> 23:29.040
Welcome to our special segment.

23:29.040 --> 23:31.250
Now, behold: the world's greatest magic trick!

23:31.250 --> 23:32.080
Impressive.

23:32.080 --> 23:32.750
Sure is!

23:33.380 --> 23:34.500
Hey! Push me that way!

23:34.500 --> 23:35.750
We're out of time.

23:47.080 --> 23:51.000
<b>THE STIRRINGS OF A BITTER GRUDGE</b>
